('INT046', 'Fee Inquiry and Adjustment', 0.95, 'Why is there a ... avoid this in the future.', 'Savings Account', 'Customer was charged a 500 rupees penalty: Cheque bounce due to insufficient funds.', 'Investigated the account, identified the cheque bounce fee, and waived it as a one-time gesture. Agent also offered to set up alerts.', 'resolved', 'The agent waived the 500 rupees penalty.', 'frustration, disbelief', 'Negative', 'The agent was polite and helpful in resolving the issue.', 9, 8, FALSE, NULL),
